      "message": "+1. It\u0027s not good to panic.\n\nWhat about splitting the current `get_hypervisor()` into `init_` and `get_`?\nThen every client can call `init_` and handle the error themselves.",
      "parentUuid": "328ac9bf_24a3e6f4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 42,
