      "writtenOn": "2023-04-24T16:50:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We just need to add `?` to all the callers.\n\nAs a base commit, that would work but would result in the code issuing a hypervisor-discovery HVC every time `get_*()` is called and/or the result of the HVC still being cached inside of the crate.\n\nInstead (or on top of such a commit), I\u0027d expect a change that replaces all occurrences of `get_*()` with a client-private `static` `Hypervisor`(`Backend`?) instance initialized through a single `get_*()` call. The client could then also add locking where necessary and/or embed the instance in a larger singleton object.",
      "parentUuid": "6d5f1a01_66b489b2",
